त्रयोदशमाह्निकम् — Trayodaśam Āhnikam

The Great Ritual: or, how to turn your body into a cosmic trident, explain to the cardinal directions that they’re literally Śiva, and get initiated without accidentally worshipping a separate bloody universe.

