Wherever your heart becomes clear, serene and capable of entering into Parameśvara.

That’s it.

Hṛdaya-prasāda.

The clarity and serenity of the Heart.

Parameśvara-samāveśa-yogyatā.

Fitness for immersion into the supreme Lord.

